@startuml
title Luồng đổi điểm thành Choice Card - happy path
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor OP
participant "OP Points UI" as UI
participant "Internal API" as API
participant "Redemption\nOrchestrator" as ORCH
database "Point Ledger" as LEDGER
participant "Giftronaut\nAdapter" as ADP
participant "Giftronaut API" as GIFT
participant "Webhook Handler" as WH

OP -> UI : Chọn mệnh giá, xác nhận email
UI -> API : POST /op-points/redemptions\nIdempotency-Key: clientRequestId
API -> ORCH : Validate user, policy, Choice Card config
ORCH -> LEDGER : Atomic HOLD(points, redemptionId)
LEDGER --> ORCH : Hold thành công
ORCH -> ORCH : Lưu redemption + outbox\nproviderKey = redemptionId
ORCH --> UI : 202 PROCESSING + redemptionId
ORCH -> ADP : Submit Choice Card
ADP -> GIFT : POST /api/v1/orders/choice-cards\nOAuth Bearer + idempotencyKey
GIFT --> ADP : PENDING/IN_PROGRESS + orderId
ADP --> ORCH : Ghi provider order
GIFT -> WH : order.delivery_complete\nX-Giftronaut-Signature
WH -> WH : Verify HMAC + dedupe eventId
WH -> ORCH : Apply provider event
ORCH -> LEDGER : HOLD -> SPEND
ORCH -> ORCH : issuance=ISSUED\ndelivery=DELIVERED
UI -> API : GET /op-points/redemptions/{id}
API --> UI : ISSUED / DELIVERED
UI --> OP : Hiển thị kết quả

note over ORCH,LEDGER
Một redemption MVP tương ứng một recipient để tránh partial outcome.
end note
@enduml
